{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（17日）早上10時06分， 據報一行16名女子，由西貢黃石碼頭出發行山；途至近蛋家灣時，其中一名中年女子突然吐血和抽筋，同行山友立即報案求助。</p><p>政府飛行服務隊派出直升機協助救起，幸她保持清醒，被送往東區醫院治理。警方正調查事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主被送往東區醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141331889236217856504218.jpeg/Eh7wAtk32OsgfAVGHxduPjLvYKvLZektd_LXsHfy17A\"/><figcaption>事主被送往東區醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"政府飛行服務派出直升機救起事主，送往東區醫院治理。（flightradar24截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188082659176222720928734.png/IPa9CmDbh8avbO4f5VOuZdM25sa4C0NYQG8DOEBvAzg\"/><figcaption>政府飛行服務派出直升機救起事主，送往東區醫院治理。（flightradar24截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"直升機將事主送往東區醫院治理。（flightradar24截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188085321900756992460395.png/dNHZgD6HuaCFcm42CPzSxQD_iUOy7QdRgpLp64KS6es\"/><figcaption>直升機將事主送往東區醫院治理。（flightradar24截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"直升機將事主送往東區醫院。（資料圖片/黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185199076489039872518463.jpeg/My6z-IYaUpCJsaYGm4D6GQvvS9x2kshpVzet-nI3rfo\"/><figcaption>直升機將事主送往東區醫院。（資料圖片/黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T04:39:21.819101+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T03:33:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T06:37:47.462621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T04:37:38.856557+00:00","content_hash":"ccf3510ea220a30faaad62745a5cb38c0534de9d45efecd32cf95f251c0d0072","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}